cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the GFMR reference specification using this metadata.
  Until a Zenodo DOI is assigned, include the website access date and
  the repository commit used in your work.
type: dataset
license: Apache-2.0
title: "Generic FUNaK-Fuelled Thermal Molten Salt Reactor (GFMR): Reference specification"
abstract: >-
  A software-agnostic reference specification for modelling and simulation
  of a generic graphite-moderated molten salt reactor, including geometry,
  design parameters, channel hydraulics, core lifetime, and material definitions.
authors:
